hadiths[42]{hadithnumber,text}:
"6972","Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) halwa (yani meethii cheez (aur shehad pasand kartey they aur Asr ki Namaz se farigh honey ke baad apni beeviyon se (unmein se kisi ke hujre mein janey ke liye) ijazat letey they aur unke paas jatey they. aik martaba aap Hafsa (Raziallahu anha) ke ghar gaey aur unke yahan us se zyada der tak thahrey rahe jitni der tak thaharney ka aap ka mamool (routine) tha. maine iske mutaalliq Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se puchha to Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke unki qaum ki aik khatun ne shehad ki aik kuppii unhein hadiya ki thi aur unhon-ne Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko iska sharbat pilaya tha. maine is par kaha ke ab main Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke sath aik heela karoongii chunanche maine iska zikr Sauda (Raziallahu anha) se kya aur kaha jab Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) aap ke yahan aaein to aap ke qareeb bhi aaeingey us waqt tum kehna ya Rasulullah ! shayad aap ne maghaafeer khaya hai? is par aap jawab dengey ke nahi. tum kehna ke phir ye boo kis cheez ki hai? Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko ye baat bahut na-gawar thi ke aap ke jism ke kisi hissey se boo aaey. chunanche Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) iska jawab ye dengey ke Hafsa ne mujhey shehad ka sharbat pilaya tha. is par kehna ke shehad ki makkhiyon ne gharfat ka ras choosaa hoga aur main bhi Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se yahi baat kahoongii aur Safiya tum bhi Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se ye kehna chunanche jab Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) Sauda ke yahan tashrif le gaey to unka bayan hai ke us zaat ki qism jiske siwa koi maabood nahi ke tumharey khof se qareeb tha ke main us waqt Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se ye baat jaldi mein keh deti jabke aap darwazey hi par they. aakhir jab Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) qareeb aaey to maine arz kya : ya Rasulullah ! aap ne maghaafeer khaya hai? Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke nahi. maine kaha phir bo kaisi hai? Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke Hafsa ne mujhey shehad ka sharbat pilaya hai maine kaha us shehad ki makkhiyon ne gharfat ka ras choosaa hoga aur Safiya (Raziallahu anhu) ke paas jab aap tashrif le gaey to unhon-ne bhi yahi kaha, iske baad jab Hafsa ke paas Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) gaey to unhon-ne arz kya : ya Rasulullah ! wo shehad main phir aapko pilaaun. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke uski zarurat nahi. bayan kya hai ke is par Sauda (Raziallahu anha) boliin . Subhan-Allah ye ham ne kya kiya maano shehad aap par haram kar diya, maine kaha chup raho."
"6973","umr bin-Khattab (Raziallahu anhu) (18 hijri maah rabeeussaanii mein) Sham (Syria) tashrif ley gaey. jab maqam Saragh par pahunchey to unko ye khabar mili ke Sham (Syria) wabaaii bimari ki lapet mein hai. phir Abdur-Rehman-bin-Auf (Raziallahu anhu) ne unhein khabar di ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya tha ke jab tumhen malum ho jaey ke kisi sar-zameen mein wabaa phailii hui hai to usmein dakhil mat ho, lekin agar kisi jagah wabaa phoot padey aur tum wahin maujood ho to wabaa se bhaagney ke liye tum wahan se niklo bhi mat. chunanche umr (Raziallahu anhu) maqaame-Saragh se wapas aagey aur ibne-Shahab se riwayat hai, unse Saalim-bin-Abdullaah ne ke umr (Raziallahu anhu) Abdur-Rehman-bin-Auf (Raziallahu anhu) ki hadis sun kar wapas ho gaey they."
"6974","Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne taaoon ka zikr kya aur farmaya ke ye aik azab hai jiske zariey kuchh ummaton ko azab diya gaya tha iske baad iska kuchh hissey baqi reh gaya hai aur wo kabhi chala jata hai aur kabhi wapas aa jata hai. to jo shakhs kisi sar zameen par iske phailney ke mutaalliq suney to wahan na jaey lekin agar koi kisi jagah ho aur wahan ye wabaa phoot padey to wahan se bhaagey bhi nahi."
"6975","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ''apne hiba ko wapas leney wala us kuttey ki tarah hai jo apni qai ko khud chaat jata hai, hamarey liye buri misal munasib nahi.''"
"6976","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne Shufaa ka hukm har us cheez mein diya tha jo taqseem na ho sakti ho. to jab had bandi ho jaey aur rastey alag alag kar diye jayen to phir Shufaa nahi. aur kuchh log kehtey hain ke Shufaa ka haq padosi ko bhi hota hai phir khud hi apni baat ko ghalat qarar diya aur kaha ke agar kisi ne koi ghar khareedaa aur usey khatrah hai ke uska padosi haqe-shuf'a ki bina par us se ghar le-lega to usne uske so hissey karke aik hissey usmein se pahley khareed liya aur baqi hissey baad mein khareedey to aisi sura mein pahley hissey main to padosi ko Shufaa ka haq hoga. ghar ke baqi hisson mein usey ye haq nahi hoga aur uske liye jaaiz hai ke ye heela kare."
"6977","Miswar-bin-Makhrama (Raziallahu anhu) aaey aur unhon-ne mere mundhey par apna hath rakha phir main unke sath Sad-bin-abi-Waqas (Raziallahu anhu) ke yahan gaya to abu-Raafe ne is par kaha ke iska char so se zyada main nahi de sakta aur wo bhi qiston mein doonga. is par unhon-ne jawab diya ke mujhey to iske panch so naqd mil rahe they aur maine inkar kar diya. agar maine Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se ye na suna hota ke padosi zyada mustahiq hai to main usey tumhen na bechtaa . Ali-bin-Abdullaah madeenii ne kaha maine Sufiyan-bin-Uena se is par puchha ke Mamar ne is tarah nahi bayan kya hai. Sufiyan ne kaha ke lekin mujh se to Ibrahim bin Maisra ne ye hadis isi tarah naql ki. aur kuchh log kehtey hain ke agar koi shakhs chahey ke Shafee ko haq Shufaa na de to usey heela karne ki ijazat hai aur heela ye hai ke jaaidaad ka Malik khareedaar ko wo jaaidaad hiba kar de phir khareedaar us hiba ke muaawaze mein Malik jaaidaad ko hazaar dirham maslan hiba kar de is sura mein Shafee ko Shufaa ka haq na rahega."
"6978","Sad (Raziallahu anhu) ne unke aik ghar ki char so misqaal qeemat lagai to unhon-ne kaha ke agar maine Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko ye kehtey na suna hota ke padosi apne padaus ka zyada mustahiq hai to main usey tumhen na deta aur kuchh log kehtey hain ke agar kisi ne kisi ghar ka hissa khareedaa aur chaha ke iska haqe-shufa baatil kar de to usey us ghar ko apne chhotey betey ko hiba kar dena chaahiye, ab nabaligh par qism bhi nahi hogi."
"6979","Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne aik shakhs ko banii-Sulaim ke sadqaat ki wsoolii ke liye aamil banaya unka naam ibne-lutbiya tha phir jab ye aamil wapas aaya aur Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne unka hisab liya, us ne sarkaarii maal alehda kya aur kuchh maal ki nisbat kehney laga ke ye (mujhey ( tohfe mein mila hai. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne is par farmaya ke phir kyon na tum apne maan-baap ke ghar baithey rahe agar tum sachey ho to wahin ye tohfa tumharey paas aa jata. iske baad Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne hamein khutba diya aur Allah ki hamd w sana ke baad farmaya, ammaa ba'd! main tum mein se kisi aik ko us kaam par aamil banata hun jiska Allah ne mujhey wali banaya hai phir wo shakhs aata hai aur kehta hai ke ye tumhara maal aur ye tohfa hai jo mujhey diya gaya tha. usey apne maan-baap ke ghar betha rehna chahiye tha taake iska tohfa wahin pahunch jata. Allah ki qism ! tum mein se jo bhi haq ke siwa koi cheez lega wo Allah Taala se us haal mein milega ke us cheez ko uthaey huey hoga balke main tum mein har us shakhs ko pehchan loonga jo Allah se us haal mein milega ke oont uthaey hoga jo bulbulaa raha hoga ya gaaey uthaey hoga jo apni awaz nikal rahi hogi ya bakri uthaey hoga jo apni awaz nikal rahi hogi. phir aap ne apna hath uthaya yahan tak ke aap ke baghl ki safedi dikhai dene lagi aur farmaya, aey Allah kya maine pahuncha diya. ye farmatey huey Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko meri aankhon ne dekha aur kanon se suna."
"6980","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya '' padosi apne padosi ka zyada haqdaar hai.'' aur kuchh logon ne kaha agar kisi shakhs ne aik ghar bees hazaar dirham ka khareedaa (to Shufaa ka haq saaqit karne ke liye) ye heela karne mein koi qabahat nahi ke Malik makan ko 9999 dirham naqd ada karey ab bees hazaar ke takmile mein jo baqi rahe yani das hazaar aur aik dirham iske badal Malik makan ko aik Dinar ( ashrafii ( de-dey. is sura mein agar Shafee us makan ko lena chaahega to usko bees hazaar dirham par lena hoga warna wo us ghar ko nahi ley sakta. aisi sura mein agar saude ke baad ye ghar (bechnewaale ke siwaa) aur kisi ka nikla to khareedaar bechnewaaley se wahi qeemat wapas lega jo usney di hai yani 9999 dirham aur aik Dinar ( bees hazaar dirham nahi wapas sakta ( kyonke jab wo ghar kisi aur ka nikla to ab wo Sauda sirf jo bechnewaaley aur khareedneywaaley ke beech mein ho gaee thi bilkul baatil ho gaee (to asl Dinar phirnaa lazim hoga na ke iski qeemat (yani das hazaar aur aik dirham ( agar us ghar mein koi aib nikla lekin wo bechnewaaley ke siwa kisi aur ki milk nahi nikla to khareedaar us ghar ko bechnewaaley ko wapas aur bees hazaar dirham us se ley sakta hai. imam Bukhari (Rahmatullahi-alaih) ne kaha to un logon ne musalmanon ke aapas mein makar w faraib ko jaaiz rakha aur Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne to farmaya hai ke musalman ke saudey mein jo musalman ke sath ho na aib hona chahiye yani ( bimari ( na khabaasat na koi aafat ."
"6981","abu-Raafe (Raziallahu anhu) ne Sad bin Malik (Raziallahu anhu) ko aik ghar char so Misqaal mein bechaa aur kaha ke agar maine Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se ye na suna hota ke padosi haq padaus ka zyada haqdaar hai to main aapko ye ghar na deta (aur kisi ke hath beech daalta ( ."
"6982","Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) par wahi ki shuruaat soney ki haalat mein sachey khuwab ke zariey hui. chunanche Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) jo khuwab bhi dekhtey to wo subah ki roshni ki tarah samney aa jata aur Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ghare-hira mein chaley jatey aur is mein tanha Allah ki yad kartey they chand muqarrara dinon ke liye ( yahan aatey (aur un dinon ka khane-pine ka saman bhi sath laatey. phir Khadija (Raziallahu anha) ke paas wapas tashrif ley jatey aur wo phir itna hi khane-pine ka saman aap ke sath kar detiin yahan tak ke haq aap ke paas achcha aa gaya aur aap ghare-hira hi mein they. chunanche usmein farishta aap ke paas aaya aur kaha ke padhiye. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne us se farmaya ke main padha hua nahi hun. aakhir usne mujhey pakad liya aur zor se daaba aur khub daaba jiski wjah se mujh ko bahut takleef hui. phir usne mujhey chhod diya aur kaha ke padhiye Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne phir wahi jawab diya ke main padha hua nahi hun. usne mujhey aisa daaba ke main be qaabu ho gaya ya unhon-ne apna zor khatm kar diya aur phir chhod kar us ne mujh se kaha ke padhiye apne rab ke naam se jisne paida kya hai. alfaz ( ما لم يعلم‏ ( tak. phir jab Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) Khadija (Raziallahu anha) ke paas aaey to aap ke moondhon ke gosht ( dar ke maarey ( phadak rahe they. jab ghar mein Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) dakhil huey to farmaya ke mujhey chadar udha do, mujhey chadar udha do, chunanche aapko chadar udha di gaee aur jab Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ka khof door ho gaya to farmaya ke Khadija mera haal kya ho gaya hai? phir Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne apna Sara haal bayan kya aur farmaya ke mujhey apni jaan ka dar hai. lekin Khadija (Raziallahu anha) ne kaha Allah ki qism aisa hargiz nahi ho sakta , aap khush rahiye Allah Taala aapko kabhi ruswa nahi karega . aap to sila rehmii kartey hain, baat sachchii boltey hain, naadaaron ka bojh uthatey hain, mehman nawazi kartey hain aur haq ki wjah se pesh aaney wali museebaton par logon ki madad kartey hain. phir aapko Khadija (Raziallahu anha) Warqa- bin Nofal bin Asad bin abdul-Uzzaa bin Qusaii ke paas laaiin jo Khadija (Raziallahu anha) ke walid khuwelid ke bhai ke betey they. jo zamana jahiliyat mein Esai ho gaey they aur arabii likh letey they aur wo jitna Allah Taala chahta arabii mein Injeel ka tarjama likha kartey they, wo us waqt bahut boodhey ho gaey they aur beenaaii bhi jati rahi thi. unse Khadija (Raziallahu anha) ne kaha : bhai ! apne bhatijey ki baat suno . Warqa- ne puchha : bhatijey tum kya dekhtey ho? Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne jo dekha tha wo sunaya to Warqa ne kaha ke ye to wahi farishta ( Jibraeel (Alaihissalam) ( hai jo Musa (Alaihissalam) par aaya tha. kash! main us waqt jawan hota jab tumhen tumhari qaum nikal degi aur zinda rahtaa. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne puchha : kya ye mujhey nikaaleingey ? Warqa ne kaha ke haan. jab bhi koi Nabi w rasool wo paigham lekar aaya jisey lekar aap aaey hain to iske sath dushmanii ki gaee aur agar maine tumharey wo din pa liye to main tumhari bharpur madad karunga lekin kuchh hi dinon baad Warqa ka intiqal ho gaya aur wahi ka silsile kat gaya aur Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko uski wjah se itna gham tha ke aap ne kai martaba pahaad ki buland choti se apne aapko gira dena chaha lekin jab bhi aap kisi pahaad ki choti par chadhey taake is par se apne aapko gira dein to Jibraeel (Alaihissalam) aap ke samney aagey aur kaha ke ya Muhammad ! aap yaqinan Allah ke rasool hain. us se Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko sukoon hota aur aap wapas aa jatey lekin jab wahi zyada dinon tak ruki rahi to aap ne aik martaba aur aisa irada kya lekin jab pahaad ki choti par chadhey to Jibraeel (Alaihissalam) samney aaey aur isi tarah ki baat phir kahi . Ibne-Abbas (Raziallahu anhu) ne kaha ( sura Al-Anaam ( mein lafz ( ‏‏‏‏فالق الإصباح‏ ( se murad din mein suraj ki roshni aur raat mein chaand ki roshni hai."
"6983","Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ''kisi nek aadmi ka achchha khuwab nabwooat ka chhiyaaleeswaan hissey hai.''"
"6984","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ''(achchhey) khuwab Allah ki taraf se hotey hain aur burey khuwab shaitan ki taraf se hotey hain.''"
"6985","unhon-ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko ye farmatey huey suna ke jab tum mein se koi aisa khuwab dekhey jisey wo pasand karta ho to wo Allah ki taraf se hota hai. is par Allah ki hamd karey aur usey bata dena chahiye lekin agar koi iske siwa koi aisa khuwab dekhta hai jo usey na-pasand hai to ye shaitan ki taraf se hota hai to iske shar se panah maangey aur kisi se aisey khuwab ka zikr na karey ye khuwab usey kuchh nuqsan nahi pahuncha sakega.''"
"6986","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya '' achchha khuwab Allah ki taraf se hota hai aur bura khuwab shaitan ki taraf se, isliye agar koi bura khuwab dekhey to usey us se Allah ki panah maangnii chahiye aur baain taraf thookna chahiye ye khuwab usey koi nuqsan nahi pahuncha sakega ''aur Abdullah-bin Yahya se unke walid ne aur unse Abdullah-bin-Ubai Qatada ne bayan kya aur unse unke walid ne Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se isi tarah bayan kya."
"6987","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ''momin ka khuwab nabwooat ke chhiyaalees hisson mein se aik hissa hota hai.''"
"6988","Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ''momin ka khuwab nabwooat ke chhiyaalees hisson mein se aik hissa hota hai.'' uski riwayat saabit, Humaid, Ishaq bin-Abdullah aur Shuaib ne Anas (Raziallahu anhu) se ki unhon-ne Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se."
"6989","unhon-ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko ye farmatey huey suna ke nek khuwab nabwooat ke chhiyaalees hisson mein se aik hissey hai."
"6990","maine Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se suna, Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke nabwooat mein se sirf ab mubashshiraat baqi reh gaee hain. sahaba ne puchha ke mubashshiraat kya hain? Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke achchhey khuwab ."
"6991","kuchh logon ko khuwab mein shabe-qadr ( Ramazan ki) saat (7) aakhiri taareekhon mein dikhai gaee aur kuchh logon ko dikhai gaee ke wo aakhiri das taareekhon mein hogi to Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke usey aakhiri saat (7) taareekhon mein talash karo."
"6992","Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ''agar main itney dinon qaid mein rehta jitney dinon Yusuf (Alaihissalam) padey rahe aur phir mere paas qaasid bulaney aata to main uski dawat qabool kar letaa.''"
"7246","ham Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki khidmat mein hazir huey. ham sab jawan aur ham umr they, ham aap ki khidmat mein bees din tak thahrey rahe. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) bahut shafeeq they. jab aap ne malum kya ke ab hamara dil apne ghar walon ki taraf mushtaaq hai to aap ne ham se puchha ke apne peechhey ham kin logon ko chhod kar aaey hain. ham ne aapko bataya to Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke apne ghar chaley jao aur unke sath raho aur unhein Islam sikhaao aur Deen bataao aur bahut si baatein aap ne kahin jin mein kuchh mujhey yad nahi hain aur kuchh yad hain aur (farmaayaa ke) jis tarah mujhey tum ne Namaz padhtey dekha isi tarah Namaz padho. isliye jab Namaz ka waqt aa jaey to tum mein se aik tumharey liye azan kahey aur jo umr mein sabse bada ho wo imamat karaaey."
"7247","Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ''kisi shakhs ko Bilal (Raziallahu anhu) ki azan sehrii khaney se na rokey kyonke wo sirf isliye azan detey hain taake jo Namaz ke liye bedaar hain wo wapas aa jayen aur jo soey huey hain wo bedaar ho jayen aur fajr wo nahi hai jo is tarah lambi dhaar hoti hai. Yahya ne iske izhar ke liye apne donon hath milaaey aur kaha yahan tak ke wo is tarah zahir ho jaey aur uske izhar ke liye unhon-ne apni donon shahadat ki ungliyon ko phaila kar batlaayaa.''"
"7248","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya '' Bilal ( Ramazan mein) raat hi mein azan detey hain (wo namaaze fajr ki azan nahi hotii) isliye tum khaao piyo, yahan tak ke Abdullaah-ibne-umme-Maktoom azan dein (to khana peenaa band kar do).''"
"7249","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne hamein Zohar ki panch rakaat Namaz padhai to Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se puchha gaya : kya Namaz (ki rak'aton) mein kuchh badh gaya hai? Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne malum farmaya ke kya baat hai? sahaba ne kaha ke aap ne panch rakaat Namaz padhai hai. phir Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne salam ke baad do sajdey (saho ke) kiye."
"7250","Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne do hi rakaat par (maghrib ya isha ki Namaz mein) Namaz khatm kar di to zul-yadain (Raziallahu anhu) ne kaha ke ya Rasulullah ! Namaz kam kar di gaee hai ya aap bhool gaey hain? Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne puchha : kya zul-yadain sahi kehtey hain? logon ne kaha ji haan. phir Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) khadey huey aur aakhiri rakatein padhein phir salam pheraa, takbeer ki aur sajda kya (namaz ke aam) sajdey jaisa ya us se lambaa, phir Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne sar uthaayaa, phir takbeer kahi aur Namaz ke sajdey jaisa sajda kya, phir sar uthaayaa."
"7251","masjide-Qubaa mein log subah ki Namaz padh rahe they ke aik aaney waley ne unke paas pahunch kar kaha ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) par raat Quran ki aayat nazil hui hai aur aapko hukm diya gaya hai ke Namaz mein Kaba ki taraf munh kar lein isliye tum bhi usi taraf rukh kar lo. un logon ke chehrey Sham (Syria) (yani baitul-maqdis) ki taraf they, phir wo log Kaba ki taraf mud gaey."
"7252","jab Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) Madina tashrif laey to aap sola ya satrah mahiney tak baitul-maqdis ki taraf munh karke Namaz padhtey rahe lekin aap ki aarzoo thi ke Kaba ki taraf munh karke Namaz padhein. phir Allah Taala ne (sura al-Baqara mein) ye aayat nazil ki (قد نرى تقلب وجهك في السماء فلنولينك قبلة ترضاها) ''ham aap ke munh ke baar-baar aasman ki taraf uthney ko dekhtey hain, an-qareeb ham aap ke munh ko is qible ki taraf pher dengey jis se aap khush hongey.'' chunanche rukh Kaba ki taraf kar diya gaya. aik sahib ne Asr ki Namaz Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke sath padhi, phir wo Madina se nikal kar Ansar ki aik jamat tak pahunchey aur kaha ke wo gawahi detey hain ke unhon-ne Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke sath Namaz padhi hai aur Kaba ki taraf munh karne ka hukm ho gaya hai chunanche sab log Kaba rukh ho gaey halanke wo Asr ki Namaz ke rukoo mein they."
"7253","mein abu-Talha Ansari , abu-Ubaida bin-Jarraah aur Ubai-bin-Kab (Raziallahu anhu) ko khajoor ki sharab pilaa raha tha. itney mein aik aaney waley shakhs ne aa kar khabar di ke sharab haram kar di gaee hai. abu-Talha (Raziallahu anhu) ne us shakhs ki khabar suntey hi kaha : Anas! un matkon ko badh kar sab ko tod de. Anas (Raziallahu anhu) ne bayan kya ke main aik haawan-dasta ki taraf badha jo hamarey paas tha aur maine iske nichley hissey se un matkon par maara jis se wo sab toot gaey."
"7254","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne ahal Najran se farmaya ''main tumharey paas aik amanat daar aadmi jo haqiqi amanat daar hoga bhejoonga.'' Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke sahaba muntazir rahe (ke kon us sifat se mausoof hai) to aap ne abu-Ubaida (Raziallahu anhu) ko bhejaa."
"7255","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ''har ummat mein aik amanat daar hota hai aur is ummat ke amanat daar abu-Ubaida ibne-Jarraah (rz) hain.''"
"7256","qabila Ansar ke aik sahib they (aos bin khaulaa naam ( jab wo Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki majlis mein shirkat na kar saktey aur main Sharik hota to unhein aa kar Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki majlis ki khabrein bataataa aur jab main Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki majlis mein Sharik na ho paata aur wo Sharik hotey to wo aa kar Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki majlis ki khabar mujhey bataatey ."
"7257","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne aik lashkar bheja aur uska ameer aik sahib Abdullah-bin Huzafa Sehmi ko banaya, phir (is ne kya kya ke) aag jalwaaii aur) lashkariyon se) kaha ke usmein dakhil ho jao . jis par kuchh logon ne dakhil hona chaha lekin kuchh logon ne kaha ke ham aag hi se bhag kar aaey hain. phir iska zikr Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se kya to aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne unse farmaya ke jinhoney aag mein dakhil honey ka irada kya tha ke agar tum usmein dakhil ho jatey to usmein qiyamat tak rahtey aur doosrey logon se kaha ke Allah Taala ki nafarmani mein kisi ki itaat halal nahi hai itaat sirf nek kaamon mein hai."
"7259","2 log Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke paas apna jhagdaa laey. dusri sanad aur imam Bukhari (Rahmatullahi-alaih) ne kaha (tafseel aagey nichey ki hadis mein hai)."
"7260","ham Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke paas maujood they ke dehaatiyon mein se aik sahib khadey huey aur kaha ke ya Rasulullah ! kitabullah ke mutabiq mera faisla farma dijiye. iske baad unka muqabil fareeq khada hua aur kaha unhon-ne sahi kaha ya Rasulullah ! hamara faisla kitabullah ke mutabiq kar dijiye aur mujhey kehney ki ijazat dijiye. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke kaho. unhon-ne kaha ke mera ladka unke yahan mazdoorii kya karta tha, ( Aseef ( ba-maanaa ( الأجير ( mazdoor hai, phir us ne unki aurat se zina kar liya to logon ne mujhey bataya ke mere betey par rajm (sangsaar) ki saza hogi lekin maine uski taraf se so bakriyon aur aik baandi ka fidya diya (aur ladkey ko chhudaa liya ( phir maine ahale-ilm se puchha to unhon-ne bataya ke uski biwi par rajm (sangsaar) ki saza laagu hogi aur mere ladkey ko so kode aur aik saal ke liye jilaa watanii ki. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke us zaat ki qism jiske hath mein meri jaan hai! main tumharey darmyan kitabullah ke mutabiq faisla karunga, baandi aur bakriyan to usey wapas kar do aur tumharey ladkey par so kode aur aik saal jilaa watanii ki saza hai aur aey Anees! ( qabila Aslam ke aik sahabi ( uski biwi ke paas jao, agar wo zina ka iqrar karey to usey rajm (sangsaar) kar do. chunanche Anees (Raziallahu anhu) unke paas gaey aur us ne iqrar kar liya phir Anees (Raziallahu anhu) ne usko sangsaar kar dala."
"7261","maine Jabir-bin-Abdullah (Raziallahu anhu) se suna, bayan kya ke Khandaq ki jang ke din Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne ( dushman se khabar laney ke liye) sahaba se kaha to Zuber (Raziallahu anhu) taiyaar ho gaey phir unse kaha to Zuber (Raziallahu anhu) hi taiyaar huey. phir kaha, phir bhi unhon-ne hi aamaadagii dikhlai . iske baad Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke har Nabi ke hawaarii ( madadgaar ( hotey hain aur mere hawaarii Zuber hain. aur Sufiyan-bin-Uena ne bayan kya ke maine ye riwayat ibne-Munkadir se yad ki aur Ayub ne ibne-munkadir se kaha, aey abu-Bakar! (ye Muhammad-bin Munkadir ki kunniyat hai) unse Jaabir (Raziallahu anhu) ki hadis bayan kijiye kyonke log pasand kartey hain ke aap Jaabir (Raziallahu anhu) ki hadisein bayan karein to unhon-ne usi majlis mein kaha ke maine Jaabir (Raziallahu anhu) se suna aur char hadison mein pai-dar-pai ye kaha ke maine Jaabir (Raziallahu anhu) se suna. Ali-bin-Abdullaah madeenii ne kaha ke maine Sufiyan-bin-Uena se kaha ke Sufiyan Sory to jang Qureza kehtey hain ( bajaey Khandaq ki jang ke) unhon-ne kaha ke maine itney hi yaqin ke sath yad kya hai jaisa ke tum us waqt baithey ho ke unhon-ne Khandaq ki jang kaha, Sufiyan ne kaha ke ye donon aik hi jang hain (kyonke) Khandaq ki jang ke fauran baad isi din jang Qureza pesh aaya aur wo muskuraaey ."
"7262","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) aik baagh mein dakhil huey aur mujhey darwaze ki nigrani ka hukm diya, phir aik sahabi aaey aur ijazat chahi . Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke unhein ijazat de do aur unhein jannat ki bashaarat de do. wo Abu-Bakar (Raziallahu anhu) they, phir umr (Raziallahu anhu) aaey, Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke unhein ijazat de do aur unhein jannat ki bashaarat de do, phir Usman (Raziallahu anhu) aaey, Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke unhein bhi ijazat de do aur jannat ki bashaarat de do."
"7263","mein hazir hua to Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) apne bula khaane mein tashrif rakhtey they aur aap ka aik kala ghulam seedhi ke uper ( nigrani kar raha ( tha maine us se kaha ke kaho ke umr bin-Khattab khada hai aur ijazat chahta hai."
"7264","Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne Kisraa parwez Shah Iraan ko khat bheja aur qaasid Abdullah-bin Huzafa (Raziallahu anhu) ko hukm diya ke khat Bahrain ke governer munzir bin saawii ke hawale karein wo usey Kisraa tak pahunchaaeyga. jab Kisraa ne wo khat padha to usey phaad diya. mujhey yad hai ke Saeed bin Musaiyab ne bayan kya ke Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne usey baddua di ke Allah unhein bhi tukdey tukdey kar de."
"7265","Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne qabila Aslam ke aik sahib Hind bin Asma se farmaya ke apni qaum mein ya logon mein elaan kar do aashoora ke din ke jisne kha liya ho wo apna Baqiiya din (be khaaey ( pura karey aur us ne na khaya ho wo roza rakhey ."
"7266","Ibne-Abbas (Raziallahu anhu) mujhey khas apne takht par bitha letey they. unhon-ne aik baar bayan kya ke qabila abdul-Qais ka wafad aaya jab wo log Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki khidmat mein pahunchey Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne puchha kis qaum ka wafad hai? unhon-ne kaha ke Rabee qabila ka ( abdul-Qais usi qabeeley ki aik shaakh hai) Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke Mubarak ho us wafad ko ya yun farmaya ke Mubarak ho bila ruswai aur sharmindagi uthaney aaey ho. unhon-ne kaha : ya Rasulullah ! hamarey aur aap ke beech mein Muzar kaafiron ka mulk padta hai. aap hamein aisi baat ka hukm dijiye jis se ham jannat mein dakhil hon aur peechhey reh janey walon ko bhi bataaein. phir unhon-ne sharab ke bartanon ke mutaalliq puchha to Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne unhein char chizon se rokaa aur char chizon ka hukm diya. aap ne eman billah ka hukm diya. malum farmaya jantey ho eman billah kya cheez hai? unhon-ne kaha ke Allah aur uska rasool zyada jantey hain. farmaya ke gawahi dena ke Allah ke siwa aur koi maabood nahi aur Muhammad (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) Allah ke rasool hain aur Namaz qaaim karne ka ( hukm diyaa) aur zakat deney kaa. mera khayal hai ke hadis mein Ramazan ke rozon ka bhi zikr hai aur ghaneemat mein se panchwan hissey (baitul-maal) mein dena aur aap ne unhein dabbaa, hantam, muzaffat aur naqeer ke bartan (jin mein Arab log sharab rakhtey aur banatey they) ke istemal se mana kya aur kabhi-kabhi muqeer kaha, farmaya ke unhein yad rakho aur unhein pahuncha do jo nahi aa sakey hain."
"7267","tum ne dekha imam Hasan Basri Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se kitni hadis ( mursalan ( riwayat kartey hain. main ibne-Umar (Raziallahu anhu) ki khidmat mein taqriban dhaai saal raha lekin maine unko Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se is hadis ke siwa aur koi hadis bayan kartey nahi suna. unhon-ne bayan kya ke Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke sahaba mein se kai ashaab jin mein Sad (Raziallahu anhu) bhi they ( dastar-khuwaan par baithey huey they) logon ne gosht khaney ke liye hath badhaya to paak beeviyon mein se aik paak bevi Ummul-Momenin Memuna (Raziallahu anha) ne aagah kya ke ye saandey ka gosht hai. sab log khaney se ruk gaey, phir Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke khaao (aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne ( كلوا ( farmaya ya ( اطعموا ( isliye ke halal hai ya farmaya ke is khaney mein koi harj nahi albatta ye janwar meri khuraak nahi hai, mujh ko iske khaney se aik qism ki nafrat aati hai."